<title>JAPAN: Sagami Rubber - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sagami Rubber - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.33		vs	    2.17</p>
<p> Operating	  162 million	 vs	   59 million</p>
